From cb56289349592a735f953434fc0cece2827ec4c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arbion Halili <99731180+ToxicPine@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 02:22:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] crosvm: add selective private RAM

Give selected guest-physical ranges private anonymous backing from a
versioned JSON map, optionally marking them KSM-mergeable. Require KVM and an
unsandboxed single process, reject incompatible modes, and prevent forked
divergence.
---
